<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WORLD YOUTH CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the second round</p>
<p>of the World Youth Cup finals on Wednesday:</p>
<p> Brazil   10   Belgium	  0  (halftime 4-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Alvaro Aquino 4, 14, Eder Silveira 33, Alex De</p>
<p>Souza 42, 49, 86, Roni Santos 68, 79, Adailton Martins 83,</p>
<p>Junior Junior 88.</p>
<p> Uruguay   3   United States  0  (3-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Marcelo Zalayeta 24, 34, Nicolas Olivera 41</p>
<p> France    1   Mexico	   0  (0-0)</p>
<p>Scorer: Peter Luccin 90.</p>
<p> Ireland   2   Morocco   1  (1-1)</p>
